OL,3,GNEWSABurst pipe leaves 6,000 properties
OL,4,Awithout water
OL,5,
OL,6,FSix thousands properties across parts
OL,7,Fof the West Midlands remain without
OL,8,Fwater following a burst pipe, with free
OL,9,Fbottled water being handed out to
OL,10,Faffected residents
OL,12,FThe disruption forced three schools to
OL,13,Fclose early on Tuesday afternoon, while
OL,14,Fhomes and businesses across Stourbridge
OL,15,Fwere affected. Ridgewood High School
OL,16,Fremains closed because of the ongoing
OL,17,Foutage.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,352,350,200,160,0,100
