OL,3,GNEWSABurst pipe leaves 6,000 properties
OL,4,Awithout water
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome customers are still experiencing
OL,7,Flow water pressure, no water supply or
OL,8,Fdiscoloured water, as Severn Trent
OL,9,Fwarned repairs to the damaged pipe are
OL,10,Fcomplex and ongoing.
OL,12,FTwo bottled water stations have been
OL,13,Fset up at Sainsbury's car park on
OL,14,FSandringham Way in Amblecote and at
OL,15,FKing George V Park on Lawnswood Road in
OL,16,FWordsley.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
